#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Omarchy Friends — a global, pseudonymous human layer for Omarchy.

The local radar remains available, but the primary Friends experience is a
federated lobby. Every install gets a generated identity, publishes a small
signed presence to public Nostr relays, and can send a bounded wave or an
explicit 25-minute focus invitation to another currently-online install
without exchanging a Friend Code. The global layer never publishes an IP
address, a real name, or an account credential.
"""

